\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The overall architecture of the proposed PhysFormer. It features a dual-stream design: a statistical stream encoded by a Transformer and an explicit physical mapping stream. These streams are fused through the Physics-Guided Gating and Alignment (PGCC) module. Future weather conditions are injected using a Gated Linear Unit (GLU) to provide explicit foresight. Finally, theory-anchored residual heads refine the predictions under physics-derived activity gates to reduce non-physical outputs.}}{7}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overall_architecture}{{1}{7}{The overall architecture of the proposed PhysFormer. It features a dual-stream design: a statistical stream encoded by a Transformer and an explicit physical mapping stream. These streams are fused through the Physics-Guided Gating and Alignment (PGCC) module. Future weather conditions are injected using a Gated Linear Unit (GLU) to provide explicit foresight. Finally, theory-anchored residual heads refine the predictions under physics-derived activity gates to reduce non-physical outputs}{figure.1}{}}
